# {{ service_name }}

`{{ service_name }}` is a generated PokerLost FastAPI service foundation with PostgreSQL,
SDK-compatible API/OpenAPI publication, observability, Docker, and Helm. Business functionality is
absent until it is defined in [`SERVICE.md`](SERVICE.md).

Read the [documentation home](docs/index.md) for the complete guide and [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md)
for normative engineering rules. Python 3.14 or newer is required.

## Install

The mandatory private `pypokerlost` dependency requires GitHub SSH read access. Create local
configuration, verify the SSH identity, and install the locked environment:

```bash
cp .env.example .env
ssh-add -l
ssh -T git@github.com
uv lock
uv sync --locked
```

Replace the local placeholders in `.env`; do not store secrets or private keys in the repository.
See [installation](docs/getting-started/installation.md) and
[configuration](docs/getting-started/configuration.md) for details.

## Run

```bash
make run
```

## Base endpoints

| method | path | operation_id | response_model |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `GET` | `/` | `{{ service_slug }}.root` | `RootResponse` |
| `GET` | `/openapi.get` | `openapi.get` | `OpenAPIResponse` |

Both responses use `ApplicationResponse`. See the [quickstart](docs/getting-started/quickstart.md)
and the authoritative [public surface](docs/api/public-surface.md).

